      "text": "Incredibly impressive win for the Sixers, who end Miami's seven-game winning streak with no Joel Embiid + very little Jaylen Brown. Cannot say enough about how dominant the duo of Tyrese Maxey and LeBron James was. Great VJ Edgecombe and Dominick Barlow games, too. Story to come! https://t.co/sgE30bWE1L",
